(SECTION 3: APPROVED FACTS AND VERIFIED CLAIMS) '
(Only the following certified claims may be published without additional legal review:) '
(- Rule AC-01: NovaTech was founded in 2021 by workflow automation specialists.) '
(- Rule AC-02: NovaTech is certified for ISO 27001 and SOC 2 Type II data security standards.) '
(- Rule AC-03: NovaTech provides a guaranteed 99.9% uptime SLA exclusively on Enterprise tiers with service credits.) '
(- Rule AC-04: NovaTech offers a 14-day free trial on all plans with no credit card required.) '
(- Rule AC-05: NovaTech is actively deployed across more than 10,000 teams and businesses worldwide.) '
(- Rule AC-06: All customer data is encrypted in transit using TLS 1.3 and at rest with AES-256.) '
() '
(SECTION 4: MANDATORY DISCLAIMERS) '
(- Rule DC-01: Every mention of the 99.9% uptime SLA must include the disclaimer: '*Applies exclusively to Enterprise dedicated clusters backed by SLA service credits.') '
(- Rule DC-02: Pricing comparisons must include the disclosure: '*Based on publicly available vendor pricing as of Q1 2026.') '
(- Rule DC-03: Third-party integration mentions \(Slack, Jira, Teams\) must include: '*All product and company names are trademarks of their respective holders.') '
() '
(SECTION 5: VISUAL AND ACCESSIBILITY GUIDELINES) '
(- Rule VA-01: All digital assets, banners, and typography must satisfy WCAG 2.1 AA contrast ratio \(minimum 4.5:1 for normal text and 3:1 for large display headers\).) '
(- Rule VA-02: Primary brand colors are Imperial Wine \(#4E1227\) and Deep Plum \(#330B18\). Rose Blush \(#F4C5D0\) is reserved for accents.) '
(- Rule VA-03: Minimum logo clear space is equal to the height of the letter 'N' in the NiyamAI monogram.) '
ET
